`render_section`, `forge-divider`, `section-label`, `font-display`, `forge-gradient-text`, `forge-support`, `forge-card`, `breathe-static`, `card-label`, `row`, `col-md-4`, `mb-5` — from `components/components.py`, `components/presentation.py`, and `generator/pages/_for_agents_content.py`.

